<b>- Drive-In Saturday -
(By DAVID BOWIE)</b>

10
00:01:48,573 --> 00:01:52,913
<i>Let me put my
arms around your head</i>

11
00:01:52,914 --> 00:01:56,314
<i>Gee, it's hot, let's go to bed</i>

12
00:01:56,315 --> 00:01:59,852
<i>Don't forget to turn on the light</i>

13
00:01:59,853 --> 00:02:03,566
